            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"concatenation-and-format\">Concatenation and format</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>+</code> joins strings. <code>format</code> places values into <code>{}</code> placeholders. Numbered placeholders such as <code>{0}</code> choose the argument by position.</span></span>"
